tch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha)\\)</span> (canonical set-coded membership structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostSupercompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\nu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\nu)\\land\\kappa\\in\\nu)\\to\n\\exists\\bar\\nu\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists j,\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},\\mathfrak V_\\nu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\in\\bar\\nu\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},V_{\\bar\\nu})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\nu,V_\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},\\mathfrak V_\\nu)\n\\land j(\\gamma)=\\gamma\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostSupercompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\nu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\nu)\\land\\kappa\\in\\nu)\\to\n\\exists\\bar\\nu\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists j,\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},\\mathfrak V_\\nu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\in\\bar\\nu\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},V_{\\bar\\nu})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\nu,V_\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_{\\bar\\nu},\\mathfrak V_\\nu)\n\\land j(\\gamma)=\\gamma\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This uses the rank-to-rank formulation: for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma&lt;\\kappa&lt;\\nu\">\\(\\gamma&lt;\\kappa&lt;\\nu\\)</span>, some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\bar\\nu}\">\\(V_{\\bar\\nu}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\nu&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\bar\\nu&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> embeds elementarily into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\nu\">\\(V_\\nu\\)</span> while fixing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The rank levels are represented by the membership structures required by the set-coded elementary-embedding predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":